You can combine multiple attributes:

assignments = {
    1: {
        "ph": "nuː jɔːk",
        "speaker": "male",
        "emphasis": "strong"
    }
}




Note: ph and lang are special attributes handled by kokorog2p. Other attributes
are stored in token metadata for downstream processing.

